# Process cases: the backend tier. No page is opened and no browser is launched.
#
# iaScriptBuilt_Process adds 41 to Counter and sets Verdict to "big" above 10, "small" otherwise.
# iaDemoE counts iaTest records into Total. Both were built with proc.py (tools/process).

use Supervisor

# defaults: Counter starts at 1 -> 42 -> big
start iaScriptBuilt_Process
check-result Verdict eq "big"
check-result Counter eq "42"
check-result Counter gt "40"

# a value passed in flips the verdict
start iaScriptBuilt_Process with Counter=-40
check-result Verdict eq "small"
check-result Counter eq "1"

# a read-data task: the count of iaTest records is what OData sees too
start iaDemoE
check-result Total ge "2"

# side effects are read over OData
check-record iaOrder iaName=Order bed 1 exists
check-record iaOrder iaName=No such order not exists
check-record iaTest iaName=active bed;iaIsActive=true exists
